<title>UK: LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets $200 mln four-year bond.</title>
<headline>LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets $200 mln four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers ABN AMRO Hoare Govett and Dai-Ichi Kangyo Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK RHEINLAND-PFALZ</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.125     MATURITY    11.JAN.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.22    PAY DATE  L-10.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.82     SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC   1.40</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
